          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/27321bbea4e14677957d342cd6241039_l04b02-una-vecina-dice-que-el-ruido-del-parque-es-peor-por-la-noche.mp3?Expires=1794099664&Signature=LdlKY3PvSouvXLNz1GFfx14mKADW9wz4CVhdyBUMaNE7i6RDGGpxo9vT7mIeX5a85MkC56S4yWIjOplJ3mM9j7mk2ckv6LJTQoz~31LtXDgpVUC1BKilZP0kR1wTi4nUyJ7N3XVyEGqoZh2KX8gvj8CgtX9SLResjTDpo5zjyXxoYgjpinkp0AAhQivqeQqXixu81gy0F2L6Tpa7bgY2cSQHMhuCs5gsSU~CVWtrr3Ro3vZGu1cPJ3zwpWJ6oQavrY7WjkjXWeJZyd4FPN5gW8TLeFi~JTXxG5CJDAKDLBZtMFY6qoRPNRGXnX1HCXAnCqSLMOxLdi23eG~~ABFesg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
